# Comware V5 transceiver manufacture information.
Value Filldown INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required SERIAL_NUMBER (\S+)
Value Required MANUFACTURING_DATE (\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2})
Value Required VENDOR_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+transceiver\s+manufacture\s+information:\s*$$
  ^\s*Manu\.\s+Serial\s+Number\s*:\s*${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s*$$
  ^\s*Manufacturing\s+Date\s*:\s*${MANUFACTURING_DATE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Vendor\s+Name\s*:\s*${VENDOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$

